        "original_id": "3ff4c250-ca38-5dca-93f5-41b7b4f61f9d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Nicholls, Norman Blake, Euros Childs, Lachlan West, Tim John\n- Bands: The Vines, Teenage Fanclub, Jonny, Gorky's Zygotic Mynci\n- Album: Wicked Nature\n- Roles: lead singer, songwriter, guitarist, producer, drummer, bassist, instrumentalist\n- Places: Australia, Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland, Glasgow\n\nFacts:\n- Craig Nicholls was born on 31 August 1977 and is an Australian musician.\n- Norman Blake was born on 20 October 1965 in Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland.\n- Craig Nicholls is best known as the lead singer, songwriter, and guitarist of the Australian alternative rock band The Vines.\n- Craig Nicholls is the only mainstay member of The Vines.\n- Norman Blake is a singer, instrumentalist, and songwriter in the Glasgow-based band Teenage Fanclub.\n- Jonny is a two-person band formed by Norman Blake of Teenage Fanclub and Euros Childs of Gorky's Zygotic Mynci.\n- The album Wicked Nature marked the first time Craig Nicholls took on the role of producer for The Vines.\n- Wicked Nature introduced a new rhythm section for The Vines with drummer Lachlan West and bassist Tim John.",
